<http://data.silknow.org/object/7a9fd22b-b719-338f-8404-864ab6856886>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "About 2 1/3 repeat units.  On natural ground, engraved design printed in brown.  Shows, in each unit, a ruined stone fountain surrounded by trees and an urn on a stone arch, upper left; a grounded bird winging by tree stumps, upper right; a tree running diagonally  to lower right, springing from a classical ruin with fluted Ionic columns; left of this, a man walks through central arch in a ruined triple arch; interspaces filled with flowering branches.  Cotton browned and brittle; some small holes.  Selvedge along left side."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/b54acf62-76b0-3f4e-8365-8811e6bb031e> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5c3875d2-f974-3de8-8700-7e0f71e69147> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "About 2 1/3 repeat units.  On natural ground, engraved design printed in brown.  Shows, in each unit, a ruined stone fountain surrounded by trees and an urn on a stone arch, upper left; a grounded bird winging by tree stumps, upper right; a tree running diagonally  to lower right, springing from a classical ruin with fluted Ionic columns; left of this, a man walks through central arch in a ruined triple arch; interspaces filled with flowering branches.  Cotton browned and brittle; some small holes.  Selvedge along left side."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7a9fd22b-b719-338f-8404-864ab6856886/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7a9fd22b-b719-338f-8404-864ab6856886/dimension/1> ;
